-- Historical provincial geography is retained. Current communes are used in address_text.
-- Excludes private/unverified schools and campus branches not yet validated individually.
-- IMPORTANT: old Thap Muoi school entries from the preliminary workbook can be
-- stale aliases after the 2026 merger. Preserve them for separate verified cleanup;
